<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
German translations for the VibeVoice layer.

Kept in their own file, apart from strings.xml, because that one is Weblate's: it carries the
upstream HeliBoard translations and is overwritten from there. These keys are the fork's own and
Weblate has never heard of them, so a merge would either drop them or leave them stranded in a file
nobody owns. Here they are ours, and an upstream sync cannot touch them.

The English originals live in values/strings.xml. Add a key there first; this file only translates.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
-->
